{"agent":"redmain-pins","data":{"body":"Fixes bug Ba5b6fdf202: ddflow pins regenerate --approval request raises ValueError: too many values to unpack (expected 2, got 3): ddflow/api/pin_files.py _regenerate_approval unpacks _load(primary, agent) into two names (log, cfg) but _load returns a 3-tuple (log, cfg, state). Reproduced: ddflow --agent <a> pins regenerate --approval request. The agent approval route for re-recording stale pins cannot file a request at all.\n\nWrite the regression test first and watch it FAIL on the unfixed code; then `ddflow complete fix-Ba5b6fdf202 --regression-test <test>` closes the bug with the task (or `ddflow bug fixed Ba5b6fdf202 --regression-test <test>` first).","fixes":["Ba5b6fdf202"],"globs":["ddflow/api/pin_files.py","tests/test_pins_regenerate.py"],"line":"","needs":[],"parent":"bugs-2","priority":10,"tags":["bugfix"],"title":"Fix bug Ba5b6fdf202: pins regenerate --approval request crashes unpacking _load"},"id":"ea7d40553f8131d6dd27cfeff","kind":"task.added","lamport":132883,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-Ba5b6fdf202","ts":"2026-11-03T17:01:33.223078Z"}
